==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~6.67 seconds<sup>90f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~6.67 seconds<sup>90f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**10 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall peons in the beginning with [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] until you have enough money. When your meatshields die, kill the peons with a low HP unit like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] (Do note that Jackie Peng doesn't die to Slime Cat even at level 50) and damage the base to trigger the boss wave. Lure Othom and Celeboodles to your base and deal as much damage to Othom as you can using units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]. Kill the Celeboodles using [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], and when Cyberhorn comes, use your Alien crowd-control units like [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] while stacking Long Distance snipers like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]] to finish off Othom.

